{"data":{"id":9,"documentId":"kl97agi6yr1jjq2lt4zulpdg","heroEyebrow":"Our Story","heroHeadingLine1":"Built for the moments","heroHeadingLine2":"that matter","heroSubtext":"A workshop obsessed with the small things — so you can stay in the music.","storyEyebrow":"How it started","storyHeading":"Founded by musicians, for musicians","storyChips":["Started by a ukulele player","Premium leather","Hand-finished detail"],"storyStatValue":"100k+","storyStatLabel":"Musicians served","valuesEyebrow":"What we stand for","valuesHeading":"Mission & values","createdAt":"2026-07-28T05:38:45.459Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-31T04:20:28.308Z","publishedAt":"2026-07-31T04:20:28.407Z","storyLead":"Kailo began with a simple idea and a deep love for music.","storyParagraphs":["Founded by an amateur ukulele player, Kailo was born from the belief that every musician deserves to carry their instrument with pride, style, and confidence. A ukulele is more than just an instrument—it's a companion, a passion, and a part of who you are. We believed its case should reflect that.","Leather has always been a timeless symbol of craftsmanship and style. By combining premium leather with thoughtful design, we set out to create instrument bags that not only protect your ukulele but also make a statement wherever your music takes you.","Every Kailo bag is crafted with meticulous attention to detail—from the precision of every stitch to the comfort of every strap and the softness of every lining. Because we know it's the little things that make a big difference.","Today, Kailo accompanies touring artists, passionate hobbyists, bedroom songwriters, and music students throughout the country, expanding its footprint to the entire world. While our community has grown, our purpose remains unchanged: to create beautifully crafted bags that protect the instruments musicians love and inspire them to carry their music with confidence."],"materialsEyebrow":"What we work in","materialsHeading":"Three materials, chosen on purpose","materialsDescription":"Every Kailo bag and strap starts as one of these. None of them were picked to hit a price — they were picked for how they wear after a year of being carried.","craftEyebrow":"In the workshop","craftHeading":"From hide to handle","craftDescription":"A bag spends longer on the bench than most people expect. Four stages, none of them rushed, and a pair of hands on it the whole way through.","audienceEyebrow":"Who carries Kailo","audienceHeading":"Made for the way you play","audienceDescription":"Touring artists, passionate hobbyists, bedroom songwriters and music students — the same bag, asked to do four very different jobs.","storyPullQuote":null,"heroImage":{"id":21,"documentId":"ldsspff1z6holree60lw7sru","name":"photo03","alternativeText":"A Kailo artisan finishing a handcrafted leather instrument bag","caption":"A Kailo artisan finishing a handcrafted leather instrument bag","focalPoint":null,"width":1400,"height":2489,"formats":{"large":{"ext":".webp","url":"/uploads/large_photo03_5e1d7ff592.webp","hash":"large_photo03_5e1d7ff592","mime":"image/webp","name":"large_photo03","path":null,"size":166.72,"width":562,"height":1000,"sizeInBytes":170726},"small":{"ext":".webp","url":"/uploads/small_photo03_5e1d7ff592.webp","hash":"small_photo03_5e1d7ff592","mime":"image/webp","name":"small_photo03","path":null,"size":42.07,"width":281,"height":500,"sizeInBytes":43082},"medium":{"ext":".webp","url":"/uploads/medium_photo03_5e1d7ff592.webp","hash":"medium_photo03_5e1d7ff592","mime":"image/webp","name":"medium_photo03","path":null,"size":92.17,"width":422,"height":750,"sizeInBytes":94382},"thumbnail":{"ext":".webp","url":"/uploads/thumbnail_photo03_5e1d7ff592.webp","hash":"thumbnail_photo03_5e1d7ff592","mime":"image/webp","name":"thumbnail_photo03","path":null,"size":4.08,"width":88,"height":156,"sizeInBytes":4176}},"hash":"photo03_5e1d7ff592","ext":".webp","mime":"image/webp","size":784.14,"url":"/uploads/photo03_5e1d7ff592.webp","previewU