:"Bedroom songwriters","body":"Something that looks right leaning against the wall, because that is where it lives."},{"id":107,"icon":"GraduationCap","title":"Music students","body":"Padding that forgives a crowded bus, and a strap that does not dig in on the walk to class."}],"cta":{"id":47,"heading":"Carry your music with pride","body":"Explore accessories built by musicians who live out of a case and on a strap — made to move with you.","buttonLabel":"Shop the Collection","buttonHref":"/products","secondaryButtonLabel":"Get in touch","secondaryButtonHref":"/contact"},"seo":{"id":196,"metaTitle":"About — Kailo","metaDescription":"Kailo was founded by musicians, for musicians. Learn how a love of the ukulele became a workshop making leather bags worth carrying.","canonicalUrl":"/about","ogImage":{"id":21,"documentId":"ldsspff1z6holree60lw7sru","name":"photo03","alternativeText":"A Kailo artisan finishing a handcrafted leather instrument bag","caption":"A Kailo artisan finishing a handcrafted leather instrument bag","focalPoint":null,"width":1400,"height":2489,"formats":{"large":{"ext":".webp","url":"/uploads/large_photo03_5e1d7ff592.webp","hash":"large_photo03_5e1d7ff592","mime":"image/webp","name":"large_photo03","path":null,"size":166.72,"width":562,"height":1000,"sizeInBytes":170726},"small":{"ext":".webp","url":"/uploads/small_photo03_5e1d7ff592.webp","hash":"small_photo03_5e1d7ff592","mime":"image/webp","name":"small_photo03","path":null,"size":42.07,"width":281,"height":500,"sizeInBytes":43082},"medium":{"ext":".webp","url":"/uploads/medium_photo03_5e1d7ff592.webp","hash":"medium_photo03_5e1d7ff592","mime":"image/webp","name":"medium_photo03","path":null,"size":92.17,"width":422,"height":750,"sizeInBytes":94382},"thumbnail":{"ext":".webp","url":"/uploads/thumbnail_photo03_5e1d7ff592.webp","hash":"thumbnail_photo03_5e1d7ff592","mime":"image/webp","name":"thumbnail_photo03","path":null,"size":4.08,"width":88,"height":156,"sizeInBytes":4176}},"hash":"photo03_5e